      "IAM modification: the baseline broadened an organization-unit exception into permission for non-owner cases. Keep exception scope local and distinguish an exception to a prohibition from an independent grant.",
      "Wire approval: the baseline added a verifier/treasury role requirement to a permission stated for any sufficiently authorized person, causing missing required permissions. Do not invent extra role restrictions.",
