    ],
    "packet_policy": "No reference policy, verification plan, raw counterexample, or validation material is included. The same packet is supplied unchanged to every automatic design stage."
  },
  "stage_instruction": "Generate a final reusable harness now using the common frozen design packet. Return only the required harness JSON."
